    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fa5dfc72def12e22cbc6c60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听了别惊讶！\n这三年来的努力竟然让我──",
      "source_fingerprint": "95a89411b7fbf6511a37cec0e5c3e8a7d8025e9608a916a59b2473c57f849443",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e37beeacbbd41315608258a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里CS结束后・传说爆诞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e1dc00a506d3e796f700a39fb50245474e0c48f89dc3fc3da9d1d907fc5e39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce71c1d664b16c089bd37f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "班长的化身──樱花进王，\n她燃烧满腔热血只为充当众人榜样，\n训练员将与这样的她一同挑战闪耀系列赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87671011815c2a8d8032a5373ecfeeae67cb1bfe757860f83bf290595cac4f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e56f7ae455d886cb8b92f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她为了成为其他学生的指标，\n高喊要以“称霸所有GⅠ赛事”为目标……\n但是想参加所有GⅠ赛事，实在不切实际。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8466eef7ddfe1d077b19a06b66ebb872c0fab116d20fd57bc05257453c10a1e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143dad3ad11da1005de81823",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过训练员的一番纠正，她决定先缩小目标，\n向包括经典赛在内的赛马娘标准路线……\n“爆进之道”上，勇往直前！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a072aa5360e0c663ed2614bd78c74e3933bafba18b59ef3248c80c37b9dbb093",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3849232e4869c6b894901e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她拥有短途马才华，却想往错误的方向努力。\n该如何让这样的她一展长才，\n成了训练员的一大难题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ac811f89b77a47f9b21a875a9412cf8353a4684a34e27f2c91214e269e28126",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2e68fc46188ca9ce8996c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "658a6babd2815f79ba6fa1da8e56fea5eb9c5983a5bc5f9ad53a33f88e7db170",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4504d476ffd57e2b0368e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王一心关注中长距离赛事，\n于是暗中研究在同世代当中表现亮眼的\n米浴以及美浦波旁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad490d2bdf267dfd606230dc903bd34eb37721168eb4d2de5b59f855dbe81f7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b94020f0fcf9739fa7efbd34",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她仔细观察这两人，研究她们的特色……\n却因此疏忽考虑自己，\n凭着一番热情就失控爆冲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e2d12bad3fdcaa825e21da4c3864deb1cf3749882fc87cb7aec79e4315996d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e20936065cb1e3b631ff506a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员因而伤透了脑筋，\n不知该如何引导这样的樱花进王。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ecc33acd6d83588d3d99185fd17ea073c543b6ef967ddab8cdbefb39bd15d03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e06d50405472bfcaeb3554ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爆进式的研究结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb370032203216a7226c0a69a7b837d1c805c24ce1e814f68993adc7b2e12f90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5cc4294e652d713b045e460",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王与训练员前来观赏\n年底最重要的赛事“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dad785b3dfdf43320f215264b23beaa046966ff0905d80d9f0f425ed6ffc2b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b721d82e1ea0575aa76441c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王满心期待，\n认为身为班长的自己正适合参加\n“有马纪念”这场赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c4f7de2e466e01b085b82b24c3e1c1b1b4715f81b660a7b0f86a1101bf2bd89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1494605c6ac462f59bbec07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以她的资质来说，\n出赛“有马纪念”几乎是不可能的事……\n不过，这份干劲似乎可以有效活用一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14654d723bf071e7b6fe3752740febec8cce978e760c47b39db6ac3fecb51814",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d71d27ed6455e17fa8c198",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员表示，\n希望樱花进王更进一步提升速度，\n而她也答应了这个要求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25db387774d16579320a2058f5de9f356ccb2a5eb275c57b9f900d9e5cba362",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be9b42fac4e327cf98da89cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爆进式的有马纪念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bded1419aff8afe16ce33255f5232681488a84490115dc76d3989b266058c75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9382e6dc010435d5e914cd8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然樱花进王被杂志报导为\n“短距离项目最被看好的选手”，\n但以经典路线为目标的她对此表达不满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5be9b9d94514464bfbfd7ea45e172cecf4d7117804ba299e1a2219fa1704b95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ee8a2471bc0da1b1066345a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，现阶段即使她脱离短距离路线，\n也很难跑出好成绩。\n于是训练员告诉她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ddf2da15285eefd651a2027c492b07ec5b7af61b0c1efc62be1d174d9db9f2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aad4c4c69ca2524315d508ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "视“春季S”的结果而定，\n今年一整年希望能以短距离赛事为主，\n让她发挥速度长才。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7659c185f2650fc14334631b492010bb002c9e57bb3d1c19b70abddac80e52d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817092d93d20ba5945ab7766",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听了训练员这番的帅气说法后，\n樱花进王大受感动，\n也更有动力参加 “春季S”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e83f16b30abfe1eb0218b6a4c671d20405e16ea41c144da6ec5acb9ef6af6ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d2b1321a490ad9fe782aa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爆进式的交换条件！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77bd41b4c4ee62c3a2d926da882d3acc88029ce890e1c45ec0c4f117d65d54fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a612554b9ed23dbeb6ecea5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了锻炼出能大幅领先西野花的速度，\n樱花进王持续进行训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d3e5497e734034c04371594754dcb3d6e1572f8100b657f792a185d88527497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46d1709d833ebb4bcb84798f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她合理地怀疑训练员是否打算\n让她成为短途马……然而！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3410e2c2c59037ebb72e8affbcf036e7df74023901de90e323010fcfa47b6403",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73b53810b5d69e3cf1274400",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王还是决定相信训练员。\n她摆脱疑虑，勇往直前！为了赢得胜利！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64dab03dac9a3a7434c5dc5f5a3215303ea076cc648b64bf0dd826262542800e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e9ecf923c860ceee73cedd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爆进式的训练……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab540ee29c7ca9aa00aca76508baaa84b5e75133d5ca6aeee24ae66c409339a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b66d35d8dadf7fd90a309f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员至今为止都巧妙地诱导樱花进王，\n让她跑短距离，然而现在训练员却开始担心，\n不知道她是否仍会老实地跑下一场赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bd2f62ac9c3b977ae7eec42cbf099062611c58a8a0a2af1a918b5bf901abe6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b454822f8d9f2b03e9e9c110",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这样的状况下，\n某天，训练员撞见樱花进王自豪地道出\n她有多么信任自己的场景。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddab981141d618a7969ac8452504eb2b1e8af7d5ec3952c03abf71194468d73c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f829d261c77dc7af9135105",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听了她的真心话，训练员再次下定决心，\n发誓要带领她走上\n能让她真正发光发热的爆进之道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd2595e83e1f653556c81bfb3921eeb66c22b36d4ebd2adf5f7b514760382702",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03883716ca2bc6fc7c5816e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爆进式的真心话",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de96ccec75ac17d1b53d5c2b8ce40c196010ff389f248e9b7926968fef66c31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7ab29b89458c0f6ebaac38",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训正是班长的表现机会。\n樱花进王铆足了劲，要连同训练在内，\n一并拿下堪为表率的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ddb97869b8ff3697628748e67dceba4cdcdbd3d6a945446a97a000c5a44781",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4666839700db826f34865420",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是为了准备“短途马S”，\n争夺“最快”这个称号，\n训练员与她的热血夏季就此开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8261afea6bf82e0169c202ad230c62a8b7cc59a0498746b8aa13928bb7b4871",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26cb0482162cfb50d70f4bf3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c6e817872adbe4db323ea7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“CBC赏”及“人马S”即将到来的今年夏天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7468ca319d8b3a0ff1b86fe428b1efe73ecc0cf0cd12002f1dc60624c5d6c616",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a14aeb68eac6601763eea077",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王为了成为其他学生的榜样，\n铆足了干劲挑战夏季集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9c0f4a5784f94fd0b33dca32c6a710679e8e09e3f88234e01c3145fb996fa1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdb3e1daa906657a2e676bf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3759f8d321331bd9b192cbcb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王参加“出道战”的当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b262cc78b655cbfab28eaed8aa53e1bc0ab48dced8090a29b8ac366ea55e98cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cc0f01e6cdb8bf90945fcdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了来场令人印象鲜明的出道，\n让观众也“啊！！”地惊叫出声，\n樱花进王迈步前往会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0d3ee754aa16a64bde064ba0c4c547809cf2d3967aedf4ea97bad97eab198db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f581f7c913686d4524ae11ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d95884de24c3efe0a038d16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让樱花进王的存在广为人知的舞台──\n“京王杯新马级S”开赛的这天到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2415525b5044dd1327ef2ae17adbdef1529d546cbaada1ab2daf917acdd98702",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf591c8e88c3fc126f76c14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她意气风发地表示，要以这场比赛\n替她的短距离赛事做个华丽灿烂的收尾──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac43dc41fd6a1a0e36df1df6740d2113c5057b073184d50029ec9c2c2c16b61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e365d3fd4b43364964bc12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说完后，樱花进王便斗志旺盛地奔向了会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7046c98e3b54ba710719c75d3388663f3e59e316d6855921e3651b648c0f4374",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01536e6a1b61ead1036a9537",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向京王杯新马级S",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7a1e4b6842fa501c4a9de7a7152e4c35fc462c2c07608209d14ba3e7b247418",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514d03df2792282ffb095ee4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“春季S”比赛当天。\n对樱花进王来说，\n1800米的距离是一大难关。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfd596be35caecdc96cfd66520284df470e86009cbb3ccd14c8d20bfca9c8e27",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c91cf17618797fa8ee98c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她自信满满地表示，\n比起之后等着她的经典战线，这还算短的。\n于是她精神饱满地上场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9a98d6e4733d55628b3e57a1f011b4c34cc96f08ad504248e0b6c7cae131a87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363168c1d15c59dcdc8092f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向春季S",
      "source_fingerprint": "d54a359acf1521645234de441475be13653284af09ff1da85c412c8a8373ccc6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a0797b7fa8a788b35b05f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了追求更快的速度，\n樱花进王即将挑战“葵锦标”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0d7fb4340988c7a4b098763fe345f2b9660fe8a7ec5fb6fbc614d6ff503d54",
